  "options": [
    {
      "id": "option_1",
      "title": "The moment I knew something was wrong",
      "duration_seconds": 72.9,
      "clips": [
        {
          "start": 34.1,
          "end": 50.6,
          "captions": [
            {
              "start": 34.6,
              "end": 36.98,
              "text": "The thing that finally made me go"
            },
            {
              "start": 36.98,
              "end": 39.36,
              "text": "to a doctor was I fell asleep"
            },
            {
              "start": 39.36,
              "end": 40.72,
              "text": "driving. Not for long."
            },
            {
              "start": 40.72,
              "end": 43.4,
              "text": "Maybe two seconds. But I drifted into"
            },
            {
              "start": 43.4,
              "end": 45.78,
              "text": "the next lane and a guy honked"
            },
            {
              "start": 45.78,
              "end": 48.16,
              "text": "at me and I pulled over and"
            },
            {
              "start": 48.16,
              "end": 50.2,
              "text": "sat there shaking for twenty minutes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "start": 68.0,
          "end": 77.4,
          "captions": [
            {
              "start": 68.5,
              "end": 70.88,
              "text": "But I pushed. I said no, I"
            },
            {
              "start": 70.88,
              "end": 73.26,
              "text": "fell asleep at the wheel, this is"
            },
            {
              "start": 73.26,
              "end": 75.64,
              "text": "not normal tired. And she referred me"
            },
            {
              "start": 75.64,
              "end": 77.0,
              "text": "to a sleep clinic."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "start": 85.22,
          "end": 117.58,
          "captions": [
            {
              "start": 85.72,
              "end": 88.1,
              "text": "Then the next day they do what"
            },
            {
              "start": 88.1,
              "end": 89.8,
              "text": "is called a nap study."
            },
            {
              "start": 89.8,
              "end": 92.18,
              "text": "They put you in a dark room"
            },
            {
              "start": 92.18,
              "end": 94.56,
              "text": "five times and tell you to try"
            },
            {
              "start": 94.56,
              "end": 97.24,
              "text": "to sleep. A normal person takes fifteen,"
            },
            {
              "start": 97.24,
              "end": 99.62,
              "text": "twenty minutes to fall asleep in that"
            },
            {
              "start": 99.62,
              "end": 102.0,
              "text": "situation. If they fall asleep at all."
            },
            {
              "start": 102.4,
              "end": 104.78,
              "text": "I fell asleep in under three minutes"
            },
            {
              "start": 104.78,
              "end": 107.16,
              "text": "every single time. And I went straight"
            },
            {
              "start": 107.16,
              "end": 109.54,
              "text": "into REM, which you are not supposed"
            },
            {
              "start": 109.54,
              "end": 112.42,
              "text": "to do. That is the diagnosis right"
            },
            {
              "start": 112.42,
              "end": 113.78,
              "text": "there. That is narcolepsy."
            },
            {
              "start": 113.78,
              "end": 116.16,
              "text": "Your brain skips the queue and goes"
            },
            {
              "start": 116.16,
              "end": 117.18,
              "text": "straight to dreaming."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "start": 117.58,
          "end": 132.22,
          "captions": [
            {
              "start": 117.58,
              "end": 119.96,
              "text": "When the doctor told me, I did"
            },
            {
              "start": 119.96,
              "end": 122.0,
              "text": "not feel sad. I felt relieved."
            },
            {
              "start": 122.0,
              "end": 124.38,
              "text": "Genuinely relieved. Because it meant I was"
            },
            {
              "start": 124.38,
              "end": 127.06,
              "text": "not lazy. I had spent six years"
            },
            {
              "start": 127.06,
              "end": 129.1,
              "text": "thinking I had a character problem."
            },
            {
              "start": 129.1,
              "end": 131.48,
              "text": "It was a neurological condition the whole"
            },
            {
              "start": 131.48,
              "end": 131.82,
              "text": "time."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "option_2",
      "title": "From falling asleep to finding an answer",
      "duration_seconds": 71.5,
      "clips": [
        {
          "start": 11.14,
          "end": 34.6,
          "captions": [
            {
              "start": 11.64,
              "end": 14.02,
              "text": "It started in my second year of"
            },
            {
              "start": 14.02,
              "end": 16.4,
              "text": "college. I was falling asleep in lectures"
            },
            {
              "start": 16.4,
              "end": 18.1,
              "text": "which, fine, everybody does that."
            },
            {
              "start": 18.4,
              "end": 20.78,
              "text": "But then I started falling asleep in"
            },
            {
              "start": 20.78,
              "end": 23.16,
              "text": "conversations. Mid sentence. Someone would be talking"
            },
            {
              "start": 23.16,
              "end": 25.54,
              "text": "to me and I would just go."
            },
            {
              "start": 26.04,
              "end": 28.08,
              "text": "I thought I was just tired."
            },
            {
              "start": 28.08,
              "end": 30.46,
              "text": "I genuinely thought for two years that"
            },
            {
              "start": 30.46,
              "end": 32.84,
              "text": "I was just a tired person and"
            },
            {
              "start": 32.84,
              "end": 34.2,
              "text": "that was my personality."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "start": 68.0,
